### Test API Đặt lịch khám
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/dat-lich
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hoTen": "Nguyen Van B",
  "soDienThoai": "0988888888",
  "bacSiId": "6a9b02d5992203b634b40f59",
